+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
+without mutating either input. Object members set to `null` in a patch are removed; arrays and other
+non-object patch values replace their target in full.
+
+```ts
+import { applyMergePatch } from 'json-toolkit';
+
+applyMergePatch(
+  { title: 'Draft', author: { name: 'Ada', role: 'editor' } },
+  { title: 'Published', author: { role: null } },
+); // { title: 'Published', author: { name: 'Ada' } }
+```
